      "value": "Let X be a finite-dimensional real normed additive group with Borel measurable space and an additive Haar measure μ. Let F,G,W be real normed additive groups and B:F→L(G,W) a continuous bilinear map. For f:X→F, f′:X→L(X,F), g:X→G, g′:X→L(X,G) and v∈X, if x↦B(f′(x)v,g(x)), x↦B(f(x),g′(x)v), and x↦B(f(x),g(x)) are μ-integrable; f has Frechet derivative f′ on tsupport(g); and g has Frechet derivative g′ on tsupport(f), then ∫B(f(x),g′(x)v)dμ=−∫B(f′(x)v,g(x))dμ."
